You must be pretty worn out, hmm?

247
00:22:38,484 --> 00:22:41,484
Damn! The Admiral found us!

248
00:22:42,484 --> 00:22:45,484
Well, you'll have plenty of time to rest up now.

249
00:22:48,484 --> 00:22:50,484
Zoro!

250
00:22:56,484 --> 00:23:10,484
